# .env.example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values.
# The .env file is NEVER committed to Git (it is listed in .gitignore).
#
# HOW TO GET A GEMINI API KEY:
# 1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/
# 2. Sign in with a Google account.
# 3. Click "Get API key" → "Create API key".
# 4. Copy the key below.
#
# The free tier is sufficient for this project.

# Copy this file to .env and replace the placeholder with your Gemini API key.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here